# Ignore rules for 00-foundations/Dockerfile. The build context is the repo root, so paths
# are relative to the root. Allow-list style: everything is excluded unless listed below,
# which guarantees _private/, .env files and other projects never end up in the image.
*
!shared/
!00-foundations/

# ...and within those, still drop local and test-only files.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/tests
**/.env
**/.env.*
00-foundations/eval
